"여기에"], "correct_turtle": ["여기에"], "turtle_explanation": "Keep '여기에' as one block — it is not this lesson's focus."}, {"id": "e2", "isTarget": true, "correct_rabbit": ["앉으세요"], "correct_turtle": ["앉", "으세요"], "turtle_explanation": "'으세요' asks someone politely to do it. After a consonant use 으세요, after a vowel use 세요."}], "options": [{"id": "o1", "text": "앉", "mode": "turtle"}, {"id": "o2", "text": "으세요", "mode": "turtle"}, {"id": "o3", "text": "세요", "mode": "turtle"}, {"id": "o4", "text": "앉으세요", "mode": "rabbit"}, {"id": "o5", "text": "여기에", "mode": "rabbit"}, {"id": "o6", "text": "앉세요", "mode": "rabbit"}, {"id": "o7", "text": "여기에", "mode": "turtle"}]}}, {"stepType": "agglutinative_quiz", "title": "Sentence Building #4", "instruction": "Build the sentence: \"Please look for the bag.\"", "contentObj": {"sentence": "가방을 찾으세요.", "translation": "Please look for the bag.", "elements": [{"id": "e1", "isTarget": true, "correct_rabbit": ["가방을"], "correct_turtle": ["가방을"], "turtle_explanation": "Keep '가방을' as one block — it is not this lesson's focus."}, {"id": "e2", "isTarget": true, "correct_rabbit": ["찾으세요"], "correct_turtle": ["찾", "으세요"], "turtle_explanation": "'으세요' asks someone politely to do it. After a consonant use 으세요, after a vowel use 세요."}], "options": [{"id": "o1", "text": "찾세요", "mode": "rabbit"}, {"id": "o2", "text": "찾으세요", "mode": "rabbit"}, {"id": "o3", "text": "세요", "mode": "turtle"}, {"id": "o4", "text": "가방을", "mode": "rabbit"}, {"id": "o5", "text": "으세요", "mode": "turtle"}, {"id": "o6", "text": "찾", "mode": "turtle"}, {"id": "o7", "text": "가방을", "mode": "turtle"}]}}, {"stepType": "agglutinative_quiz", "title": "Sentence Building #5", "instruction": "Build the sentence: \"Please read a book at the library.\"", "contentObj": {"sentence": "도서관에서 책을 읽으세요.", "translation": "Please read a book at the library.", "elements": [{"id": "e1", "isTarget": true, "correct_rabbit": ["도서관에서"], "correct_turtle": ["도서관에서"], "turtle_explanation": "Keep '도서관에서' as one b